{"slug":"diving-water","name":"Diving & Water","subs":["Dive Centres","Island Hopping","Snorkeling","Canyoneering","Boat Charters"],"seo":"Cebu is a diving island: the sardine run and turtles at Panagsama, thresher sharks off Malapascua, whale sharks at Oslob, and the canyoneering route down to Kawasan. This section lists dive centres with real instructors and gear, snorkelling and island-hopping operators, and boat charters — with prices and certification level so you know what you are signing up for before you reach the beach.","subSeo":{"Dive Centres":"PADI and SSI centres with instructors, courses and daily boats — sardine run, turtles and thresher sharks.","Island Hopping":"Boat trips to Pescador, Sumilon and the Camotes — half and full-day charters with snorkel gear.","Snorkeling":"Reef and whale-shark snorkelling, including the Oslob operators, with gear and guide included.","Canyoneering":"The Badian canyon route down to Kawasan Falls — guides, gear and transfers from the city or Moalboal.","Boat Charters":"Private bancas and boats by the hour or day for diving, fishing and island trips."},"items":[{"id":"ChIJR8sZ62npqzMRdM7A0pN9sR4","name":"PH Kawasan Canyoneering","tier":"Verified","subs":["Canyoneering"],"sub":"Canyoneering","area":"Badian","address":"V96V+7V2 Upper Solong-on, Brgy. Poblacion, Badian, Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"5","reviews":"2444","lat":9.8608807,"lng":123.39545690000001,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=PH%20Kawasan%20Canyoneering&query_place_id=ChIJR8sZ62npqzMRdM7A0pN9sR4","website":"http://www.phkawasancanyoneering.com/","instagram":"","phone":"+63 917 722 1704","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"PH Kawasan Canyoneering delivers an unforgettable, thrill-packed adventure set in breathtaking natural landscapes. Visitors consistently praise the exceptional guides who prioritize safety, keep energy high with humor, and take incredible photos and videos throughout the trek. The experience is seamlessly organized, featuring smooth morning pickups and a delicious lunch provided afterward. Practical tip: bring plenty of energy and courage, and trust your guides to take care of everything else!","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJ8-vXXgBxqzMRxSnsGAljhOY","name":"Whale Shark Dive Camp","tier":"Verified","subs":["Snorkeling"],"sub":"Snorkeling","area":"Santander","address":"C8CW+59M, Pasil, Santander, Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"4.9","reviews":"19","lat":9.4204594,"lng":123.34593059999999,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Whale%20Shark%20Dive%20Camp&query_place_id=ChIJ8-vXXgBxqzMRxSnsGAljhOY","website":"https://whalesharkdivecamp.com/","instagram":"","phone":"+63 968 203 7187","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"Whale Shark Dive Camp offers a peaceful, laid-back beachfront escape away from Oslob's crowds, featuring spacious, pristine rooms with breathtaking ocean views. Guests praise the exceptionally helpful staff and seamless diving experiences with Deep Zone Dive Center, covering whale sharks, Sumilon Island, and vibrant night dives. For the best experience, stay at least a couple of nights, book your night dives early, and enjoy snorkeling right off the private beach.","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJ_RsNXj3pqzMRJY3dMaE_U2A","name":"Whaleshark Oslob Snorkeling from Moalboal","tier":"Verified","subs":["Island Hopping"],"sub":"Island Hopping","area":"Moalboal","address":"Panagsama Rd, Moalboal, 6032 Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"4.4","reviews":"14","lat":9.9498607,"lng":123.3668143,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Whaleshark%20Oslob%20Snorkeling%20from%20Moalboal&query_place_id=ChIJ_RsNXj3pqzMRJY3dMaE_U2A","website":"","instagram":"","phone":"+63 956 485 6317","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"Embarking on this tour offers a thrilling and unique opportunity to swim alongside majestic whale sharks, sea turtles, and massive sardine shoals. To make the most of your experience and beat the massive crowds, it is essential to start very early in the morning, around 4:00 AM to 7:00 AM. Renting a GoPro can help secure better assistance and photos from the boat crew, while scuba diving offers a quieter alternative to crowded surface waters.","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJ43NCemHpqzMREB3z-Bv1pg4","name":"Yaya Sosyalera Both PADI and SSI SCUBA DIVING INSTRUCTOR, Moalboal PHILIPPINES","tier":"Free","subs":["Dive Centres"],"sub":"Dive Centres","area":"Cebu City","address":"Panagsama Beach, Basdiot, Cebu, 6032 Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"5","reviews":"269","lat":9.946420999999999,"lng":123.36855199999998,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Yaya%20Sosyalera%20Both%20PADI%20and%20SSI%20SCUBA%20DIVING%20INSTRUCTOR%2C%20Moalboal%20PHILIPPINES&query_place_id=ChIJ43NCemHpqzMREB3z-Bv1pg4","website":"https://yayasosyalera.com/","instagram":"","phone":"+63 915 204 2337","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJjSh592aVqzMRsVGwXPaD18k","name":"SB Kawasan Canyoneering","tier":"Free","subs":["Canyoneering"],"sub":"Canyoneering","area":"Badian","address":"Badian, 6031 Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"5","reviews":"263","lat":9.825600399999999,"lng":123.37816009999999,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=SB%20Kawasan%20Canyoneering&query_place_id=ChIJjSh592aVqzMRsVGwXPaD18k","website":"","instagram":"","phone":"+63 992 516 7743","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJ1UVmiyd1qzMRKkbMVPnONuw","name":"Diving Nem